  "title": "Strawberry Refrigerator Cake",
  "description": "This strawberry refrigerator cake is made with a boxed cake mix, fruit purée, instant vanilla pudding, and whipped topping for a cool summer dessert.",
  "authors": [
    "Deborah Westbrook"
  ],
